# Shell scripts must check out with LF everywhere: a CRLF docker-entrypoint.sh dies inside
# the Alpine image with an unhelpful "not found", and the infra scripts break the same way
# under WSL. This overrides core.autocrlf=true, the Git-for-Windows installer default —
# without it, any docker build from a Windows checkout ships a broken entrypoint.
*.sh text eol=lf
